<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">EFESO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku bisi-Efeso</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wusonika Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">EFESO</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotoko</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wu sonika Pawuli ku minkwikidi mii ku mbanza yi Efeso. Kansi bulenda ba ti ka ku kaka ko kasonikina wo, mu dyambu ti mu mabuuku mamingi mantete, «Efeso» kadi mu kibuku ki ntete ko. Bu yenika ti Pawuli wusonika wo ku minkwikidi mi mimingi mi zizingi zimbanza yi kizunga ki Aziya mwanki batambasana wo. Bu kasonikina mukanda bewuwu, buna mu boloko kadi ku mbanza yi Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso, yiba mbanza yimbote, yi vula nsangu mu mbanza zimvimba zi Loma zidi mu kizunga ki Aziya. Babingi ha kati di yobobo bakwe zakalanga ku mbanza bewowo badi minkiti. Batunga nzo yi nkatika ntoko yi nzambi awu yi bakwe sambilanga Alitemise mu ndinga yi ki Ngeleke na Dyani mu ndinga yi bisi-Loma. Alitemise kiteki kidi, na mukento wudi. Ni mu nzo beyoyo yi toma bedi kwendanga mu musambila. Bisi-Efeso bamvimba bakwe kwikilanga mu kiteki bekyokyo, kansi ka Bayudayo na yobobo bakwe kwikilanga mu Klisto ko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli bu kavutuka ku mbanza yi Efeso mu nzyetolo yinzole, wulonga Bayudayo bakwe ba koko, mu kilumbu kyawu ki lumingu. Mboki wuvutuka, mu dyambu ti ka bufwanakana ko ti kazingila koko, kansi wubateela ti mbo kavutuka. Bu kavutuka mu nzyetolo yitatu, wuhyokisa mvula zitatu koko mu tatamana mu longa bantu. Tala mu Mavanga ma Zintumwa kapu 19-20.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mukanda bewuwu, Pawuli wuna zonzila bonso dyambu dinkudi, mabanza ma ntangu zimvimba ma Nzambi. Yandi ti: Nzambi wutuzabikisi mansweki ma kakubika mu bumbote bwandi. Mpila mosi ti Nzambi waayonzika bima bimvimba bii ku yulu na bii ha butoto, mwanki biba ku nsye lutumu yi mfumu yimosi, ni Yesu-Klisto. Wuna bwesa ta dyaka ti minkwikidi mimvimba mifweti yuwasana, na bazinga mu kimpangi. Ka mu sa dyaka ko diswaswani mu baa Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo. Mu tantu awu wumosi kwandi wudi, ni Satana. Buna bafweti sambila ha kimosi, mwanki Satana kalembo bayaala. Pawuli wuta dyaka bwedi bakala kafweti zakidila na mukento andi, na bwedi baala bafweti vuminina matata mawu, na bwedi mpe mindongo mifweti vuminina yobobo babavwidi. Wuta ti minkwikidi mifweti ba muntu wumosi mu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi :</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Lutusakumuna mu Mpeve Yilongo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1.3–3.21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Luzingu lumona mu kintwadi na Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4.1–6.20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Mbote yi mansukina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6.21-24</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto mu luzolo lu Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Nsonikini ku bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi bakwe banga ku mbanza yi Efeso, baa bakwikama mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Bika Nzambi Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusakumunu lu Nzambi mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Masiika ku Nzambi, Tata di Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto! Wutusakumuna mu tuhaana lusakumunu lumvimba lu kimpeve mu Klisto ku Yulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Tekila mbadukulu yi Nza, Nzambi wutusoola mu ba bantu bandi mu Klisto, mwanki tuba balongo na balembolo ba na kibila ha ntadisi andi. Mu luzolo lwandi, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Nzambi wukisiila, tuka ntama, ti tuba baala bandi mu Yesu-Klisto. Mu bumbote bwandi, wutya ti bubela bobo. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Ni hahoho, tukembileeno Nzambi mu dyambu di bunene bu bumbote bwandi bu katusiila mu Mwana andi wu katomini tya.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Mu yandi, tutambula nkudulu mu menga mandi matengolo, mpe ndemvokolo yi masumu meto bonso budi kimvwama ki bumbote bwandi. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Nzambi wutuhaana kyo mu kitezo kivudila mu ndwenga zimvimba na mu madyela mamvimba. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Yandi wutuzabikisa mansweki ma luzolo lwandi, bonso bukakubikila mabanza mandi mambote mu Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Mabanza bemomo, maalungisa Nzambi ku nsukunu yi ntangu ni: mu kutikisa ha kimosi bimvimba bi ku Yulu na bi ha butoto, ku nsye lutumu lu Mfumu yimosi, ni Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Mu yandi, tutambudi kikunku kyeto ki difwa, mu dyambu ti wutusoola tuka ntama bonso budi mabanza mayondowo kwe hidikanga bimvimba bonso buu nzengolo yi luzolo lwandi. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Yeto tuba bantete mu sa kivuvu kyeto mu Klisto, bika tukembila nkembo andi.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Yeno mpe, bulumana yuwa mambu mandi ma kikedika, Musamu Wumbote wuluheeni mpulusu. Mu Klisto lusidi kiminu, mpe lutambudi kidimbu ki Mpeve Yilongo yi kasila nsilulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Mpeve Yilongo ni fwa dintete mu bima bi tukubikila Nzambi. Mbo tutambula byo bu twaabaka nkudulu yilunga. Ni hahoho, tumukembileeno.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wusambidila bisi Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ni hahoho, bu nayuwa nsangu zi kiminu kyeno mu dyambu di Mfumu Yesu na luzolo lweno ku bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />nina tatamana mu vutula matondo ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyeno. Bu nakwe sambilanga, nakwe lubambukilanga moyo, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />mpe nakwe lombanga ku Nzambi yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, Tata di nkembo, ka luhaana Mpeve yi ndwenga ya luzabikisa bonso bu kadi, mwanki lutoma mu zaba. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Bika kakyenzola mitima myeno, mwanki lubakula kivuvu kyandi ki kalukubikila mu mbokolo eno. Mpe lubakula kimvwama kinkembo mu difwa di kakubika ha kati di bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />mpe lubakula lulendo lungitukulu luu nandi mu yeto tukwe kwikilanga. Lulendo na ngolo zandi, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />za kalonka mu mfulukulu yi Klisto mu bafwa, mpe wumuzakisa ku Yulu, ku kooko kwandi ku lubakala. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Klisto bamuhaana luyaalu lu zintinu zimvimba, lu zimfumu zimvimba, lu bamvimba baa na lulendo, lu bamvimba bakwe yaalanga nza mpe lu konso nkumbu yi balendi zonzila mu ntangu beyiyi na yina kwiza. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nzambi wutuula bima bimvimba ku nsye lutambi lu Klisto mpe wumuhaana ku dibundu mu ba mutu wu dibundu. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Dibundu ni nitu yi Klisto, Klisto wuu nkatika mu dibundu, mpe Nzambi wuu nkatika mu Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi kwe haananga luzingu mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Mu ntama, yeno luba bonso bantu bafwa mu dyambu di mambi meno na masumu meno, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />lulanda nkadulu zinza beyiyi, luvumina mfumu yi zimpeve zimbi wuna yaala ha kati di yulu na butoto, mpeve beyoyo yina sala bwabu ku yobobo bakwe lembolo tumiminanga Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Yeto mpe, tuba bonso yawu, twedi dyatila bonso bu nsatu zi nitu zeto. Twedi sadila luzolo lu nitu na mabanza meto, ni hahoho, yeto mpe tuba bantu bafweti sembo mu nganzi zi Nzambi bonso bahiika.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Kansi Nzambi wudi wufuluka mu nkenda, mu dyambu ti luzolo lwandi lulunene lu katutiila. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Yeto bu tuba bafwa mu dyambu di masumu meto, wutuhaana dyaka luzingu mu Klisto. Ni mu mulemvo wu Nzambi yeno lubakila mpulusu. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Mu kintwadi kyeto na Yesu-Klisto, Nzambi wutufulukisa nandi na wutuzakisa nandi ku yulu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Wulonka bumbote bwandi ku yeto mu Yesu Klisto. Nzambi wusa bobo mwanki kalonka mu ntangu zina kwiza, bonso budi bunene bu mulemvo andi. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Mu dyambu ti ni mu mulemvo wu Nzambi lubakila mpulusu, mu nzila yi kiminu . Mpulusu beyoyo yifuma ku yeno bende ko, munkayulu wu Nzambi wudi. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ka mu mavanga meno ko lubakila yo, mwanki kulembolo ba muntu wuna kitumpidika. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nzambi wutuhidika. Wutuhidika mu Yesu-Klisto mu dyambu di misamu mimbote mi katukubikila tuka ntama, mwanki tusadila myo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanda dimosi mu Yesu-Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ni hahoho bambukeno moyo, bwedi luba mu ntama, yeno luba Bayudayo bambutuka ko, balutumisina bantu balembolo zengoso bubakala ku yobobo ba kwe kitumisanga ti, bantu bazengoso bubakala mu dyambu ti basa bifu mu nitu zawu mu nzila zi moko ma bantu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, luba na Klisto ko. Banzenza luba, yeno luba mu mukangu wusoola Nzambi ko, mpe luba mu kati di nsilulu zisiila Nzambi ku bantu bandi ko. Luba bantu balembolo ba na kivuvu mpe balembolo zaba Nzambi mu nza beyiyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Kansi mu kintwadi kyeno na Yesu-Klisto, yeno luba kitatu, lweka bwabu bafinama mu nzila yi menga ma Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ninga, mu dyambu ti yandi wuu kiyenge kyeto, yandi wusidi ti Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo baba muntu wumosi. Mu bula kibaka ki kitantu kyedi bakabula, wuyekola nitu andi ha kulunsi, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />katudi lulendo lu Misiku mi Bayudayo ha kimosi na ntumumunu mpe na nsikudukusu zawu, mwanki makanda mamamole makituka kanda dimosi dimoona mu yandi. Ni bwabobo kasiididi kiyenge. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Mu mfwilu andi ha kulunsi, Klisto wubundisa makanda bemomo mamamole mu nitu yimosi mpe wubawisisa na Nzambi. Mu mfwilu andi ha kulunsi wukatula kitantu ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Klisto wuyiza mu samuna kiyenge bonso musamu wumbote ku yeno luba kitatu, na ku yobobo baba bela-bela. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Mu dyambu dyandi, yeto bawonso Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo tulenda finama ha ntadisi yi Tata, mu Mpeve yimosi kaka.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Ni hahoho, yeno lusidi dyaka zinzenza hoti minyizila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minyizila, mukongo, mpe bakongo: ni bantu bebobo ba bakwe sumbanga</char></note> ko, kansi lweka bisi nsi, bantu balongo mpe luvwihulu mu kanda di Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Yeno lweka nzo yitungu ha yulu lufulu lu zintumwa na mimbikudi, Yesu-Klisto yandi bende ni tadi di mfunu dikwe simbanga nzo. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ni mu yandi ntungulu yimvimba yii yikangama ha kimosi, mpe yii yitelama mu ba mu Mfumu nzo yilongo. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mu yandi, yeno mpe balutunga ha kimosi na yawu mu ba nzo yikwe zakalanga Nzambi mu Mpeve.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ni hahoho, meno Pawuli, nidi nkole yi Yesu-Klisto mu dyambu di yeno lulembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Yeno luyuwa bwedi Nzambi, mu mulemvo andi, kampanina kisalu mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Nzambi wunzabikisa mansweki ma mabanza mandi bonso buna tonini mu sonika mo, mu mwa ndambu mpova zifyoti, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />mpe bu lwaatanga mo, mbo lubakula madyela ma mansweki maa naani matadidi Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Nzambi kazabikisa mansweki bemomo ku bantu ba mbandu zi ntama ko, kansi mu Mpeve andi, zabikisi mo bwabu ku zintumwa na ku mimbikudi myandi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Mansweki bemomo ni ema: mu nzila yi Musamu Wumbote, yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo baa kintwadi na Bayudayo mu bima bi kubikila Nzambi mukangu andi. Yawu beka binama bi nitu yimosi, mpe beka kintwadi mu nsilulu yi basila Nzambi mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Meno nayikidi kisadi ki Musamu Wumbote mu dyambu di munkayulu wumpana Nzambi mu bumbote bwandi. Yandi wumpana wo mu nzila yi lulendo lwandi. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ku meno, muntu wunsuka ha kati di balongo bamvimba, Nzambi kasiila mulemvo mu samuna ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo kimvwama kilembolo nsukunu mu Klisto, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />mpe mu lonka ku bantu bamvimba, tuka mu tuka, bwedi Nzambi kaswekila mansweki ma misamu bemyomyo mu yandi wuhidika bimvimba[Yesu-Klisto], <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />mwanki mu nzila yi dibundu, zimfumu na baa na lulendo ku Yulu, ba zaba bwabu ndwenga zizingi zi Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Bonso budi mabanza ma Nzambi, mu mimvu ka mimvu, ma kalungisa mu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Mu yandi, mpe mu kiminu kyeto mu yandi, tudi na kimpwanza kye finama ku Nzambi na kivuvu kimvimba. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ni hahoho, nina lulomba mulembolo lebakana mu dyambu di zimpasi zi nina yena mu dyambu dyeno, kadi zidi nkembo eno.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzolo lu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ni hahoho nafukimini ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, Tata, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />ku yandi makanda mamvimba maa ku yulu na maa ha butoto matambula nkumbu awu. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Nina mulomba, bonso budi kimvwama ki nkembo andi, katoma lusyamisa mu kati di kimuntu kyeno, mu lulendo lu Mpeve andi, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />mpe Klisto kazakala mu mitima myeno mu nzila yi kiminu, mwanki lumena myanzi na lukangama nakekete mu luzolo, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />mwanki lu ba na lulendo lwe zabila, ha kimosi na balongo bamvimba, bunene, bula, kuzangama mpe sunda yi luzolo lu Klisto, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />mpe mu zaba luzolo lu Klisto luhyokidi ndwenga zimvimba, mwanki bimvimba bii mu Nzambi biba bifuluka mu yeno.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Ku yondowo lenda hidika, mu lulendo luna sala mu yeto, misamu mimingi mi hyokidi kitezo mu myo mi tulenda lomba mpe mi tulenda yindula, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />bika, mu Yesu-Klisto, kakemboso mu dibundu, mu mbandu zimvimba, mu mimvu ka mimvu. Ameni!<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kintwadi ki nitu yi Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Meno nkole yi Mfumu, nina lulomba mu ba na nkadulu yimbote mu mbokolo yi lutambudi, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />beeno na luyinunu, na lembami, na luvibudulu, mboki vibidileno nkadulu zi baneeno mu luzolo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Seeno ngolo mu keba kintwadi ki Mpeve mu nzila yi kiyenge. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nitu yimosi kwandi yidi na Mpeve yimosi kwandi mpe yidi. Bumosi mpe kivuvu kimosi kwandi kidi bonso mbokolo yi lutambula ku Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Mfumu yimosi kwandi yidi, kiminu kimosi mpe mbotokolo yimosi kwandi yidi, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nzambi yimosi kwandi yidi, Tata di bamvimba. Yandi wuu ha yulu yi bima bimvimba, kwe salanga mu bamvimba, mpe wuu ha kati di bamvimba.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kadi muntu mu yeto wutambula munkayulu bonso Klisto bu katezila wo mu muhaana. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ni hahoho, kateela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«Wutomboka mu yulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">wunata zinkole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">mpe wuhaana minkayulu ku bantu.»<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />«Wutomboka», mbangululu yawu nki e? Yina lonka ti: wukulumuka ku nsye butoto e? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Yondowo wukulumuka, ni yandowo kwandi mpe wutomboka kuhyoka yulu, mwanki kafulusa nza yimvimba. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Yandi wusa ti bahiika baba zintumwa, bahiika mimbikudi, bahiika milongi, bahiika dyaka mimvungi mpe bahiika milongisi, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />mwanki kakubika bantu balongo mu sala kisalu kyawu, mu ntungulu yi nitu yi Klisto, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />natee yeto bamvimba bu twaaba bakangama mu kintwadi ki kiminu na twaazaaba Mwana-Nzambi, bu twaaba bantu bameni kula mpe bu twaatuula mu kitezo ki bantu balunga bonso Klisto kaa wulunga. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ni hahoho, twaabwesa ba dyaka mwa baala bafyoti ko bana ningusu ku ndambu ka ndambu ku bipo bi mamba, bana natu ku ndongosolo zi mumpila-mumpila, mpe bana hunu ku bantu bana bazimbikisa mu madyela ma luvunu. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Kansi mu zonza kikedika mu luzolo, twaakula mu misamu mimvimba myaatunata ku Klisto, wuu mutu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ni mu yandi nitu yimvimba yidi yikangama huma hamosi mu lusadusu lu misunya na misisa mikwe vukisanga nitu. Buna kadi kinama ki nitu kikwe salanga kisalu kyandi mu kitezo kifwanakani, mpe nitu yimvimba yikwe kulanga na yikwe tungamanga yawu bende mu zola.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzingu lumona mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Taleeno misamu emi mi nina luteela mpe nina lusikimisa mu nkumbu yi Mfumu: Lulendi bwesa dyatila bonso bantu balembolo zaba Nzambi ko, yawu bakwe landanga mabanza mawu mampamba-mpamba. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Mu dyambu ti madyela mawu maa ku nsye kitombe, yawu baa kintwadi na luzingu lukwe hananga Nzambi ko, mu dyambu di bunzimbu bwawu mpe mitima myawu midi mikangama. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Basidi dyaka na nsoni ko. Bayambukidi mu sadila kindumba, mu hidika misamu mimvimba mimbi bonso bubatiidi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Kansi yeno kabwabobo ko lulongokila mu zaba Klisto, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />tala ti yandi luyuwa, mpe mu yandi baluhaanina ndongosolo, nkatika bonso budi kikedika kii mu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Buna lufweti katuka mu kimuntu kyeno ki ntama, kii kwe fukusungu mu landa nsatu zi luvunu. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Bika Mpeve yilongo yi lukitula bamoona mu madyela meno, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />mpe beeno bantu bamoona ba hiduku ku Nzambi mu lunungu na bulongo bu tukanga ku kikedika.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ni hahoho, bikeno luvunu, mpe kadi muntu kata kikedika ku munandi, mu dyambu ti yeto bamvimba tudi binama bi nitu yimosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Tala ti lubeki mankesi, luholandi masumu ko, mpe bikeno mankesi meno tekila ntangu yidyama. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Luhaanandi hwakisa ku nkadyampemba ko. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Mwivi wukwe yibanga ka biika mu bwesa yiba, kansi mu moko mandi, kasala kisalu kidedama mwanki kabaka bima bye sadisila yobobo baa mu mbindumunu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Luduukisandi kani dyambu dimosi dimbi mu minwa myeno ko. Kansi duukiseeno misamu mimbote na mii nkinzi myaasadisa baneeno bonso buu mbindumunu zawu na myaaheeka lusakumunu ku yobobo bana yuwa myo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Luyenisandi Mpeve Yilongo yi Nzambi kyadi ko, yi balutula bonso kinyemo, mu dyambu di kilumbu ki nkudulu. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Looseeno misamu mimvimba mindudi, mi mankesi, mi nganzi, kuzangula mbembo, mpe bituku. Katuleeno misamu mimvimba mi mbi ha kati dyeno. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Beeno bantu bambote mpe bankenda yeno na yeno, lemvokileeno baneeno bonso Nzambi bu kalulemvokila mu Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ludyata mu kya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Buludi ti baala batomini tya Nzambi, beeno bonso yandi. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Dyatileeno mu zola, bonso Klisto katuzodila mpe wukihaana yandi bende ku Nzambi bonso munkayulu na munkayulu we yoka wu kwe hananga mfuku yimbote yikwe yangidikanga Nzambi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Kindumba, busafu na nzinunu zimbi, bilendi yenika ha kati dyeno ko bonso bufwanakani ku bantu balongo. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ludukisangandi mpova zinsoni ko, ka zi buhulu hoti zimbi ko, mu dyambu ti buu bumbote ko, kansi duukisangeeno mpova ze vutudila matondo ku Nzambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Kansi tomeeno we zaba ti: kunaani muntu wukwe sadilanga kindumba, busafu, hoti zinzinunu zimbi (zidi mpe nsambudulu zi biteki) wulenda byadila difwa mu Kimfumu ki Klisto na ki Nzambi ko.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Muntu kaluhunandi mu nzonzolo andi yi luvunu ko. Misamu bemyomyo mikwe twalanga nganzi zi Nzambi ku yobobo bakwe lembolo mu tumiminanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Lubandi kintwadi nawu ko. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Mu ntama luba ku nsye kitombe, kansi mu kintwadi na Mfumu, bwabu lweka kukya. Ni hahoho, dyatileeno bonso baala baa mu kya. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Mu dyambu ti kya kukwe butanga mbutu yii bumbote, lunungu na kedika. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Zabangeeno mu bakula nki bikwe yangidikanga Mfumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ka lubandi kintwadi na nsadulu zi kitombe zikwe lembolo butanga mbutu zimbote ko, kansi tungudileeno zo. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Mu dyambu ti misamu bemyomyo mikwe hidikanga bantu mu mansweki, nsoni midi mu zonzila. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Kansi mimvimba mi kwe totulanga, mikwe toma yenikanga mu kya, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />mu dyambu ti mimvimba mikwe totokanga, mikwe kitukanga myabende kya. Ni hahoho bateela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Vumbuka ngeye wuu ku tolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">totuka kwaku mu bafwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">mpe Klisto waakukyenzola.»<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ni hahoho, kebeno kweno mu ndyatulu eno. Ludyatilandi bonso bantu balembolo ba na ndwenga ko, kansi bonso bantu baa na ndwenga. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Sadileeno ntangu, kadi bilumbu byeka bimbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ni hahoho, lubandi bantu balembolo ba na madyela, kansi soseeno mu zaba bwedi buu luzolo lu Mfumu.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Lukolwandi malamu ko: mawu makwe natanga ku nzimbusulu, kansi beeno bafuluka mu Mpeve. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Syamasaneeno mu mikunga, mu mikunga mi nzitusu na mu mikunga mi kimpeve, Yimbidileeno na zitiseeno Mfumu mu mitima myeno mimvimba. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Ntangu zimvimba, vutulangeeno matondo ku Nzambi Tata mu misamu mimvimba, mu nkumbu yi Mfumu eto Yesu Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babakala na bakento</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Lufweti tumama yeno na yeno mu dyambu di kivumi kii neeno mu Klisto,<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Bakento, tumimineeno babakala beno, bonso bu lukwe tumiminanga Mfumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Mu dyambu ti bakala wuu mfumu yi mukento, bonso Klisto kadi Mfumu yi dibundu. Dibundu ni nitu yi Klisto, mpe yandi wudi Muvuukisi yi dibundu dyandi. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Bonso dibundu dikwe tumiminanga Klisto, bwabobo mpe bakento bafweti tumimina babakala bawu mu mimvimba.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Babakala, tyeeno bakento beeno bonso Klisto bu katiila dibundu na bu kakiyekola mu dyambu dyandi, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />mwanki kabyeka dyo diba dilongo, bu kameni dye vedisa mu mamba na mu Mambu mandi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />mu yenikisa ha ntadisi andi dibundu dinkembo dilembolo ba na matona, na mifisu-mifisu hoti na dyambu dihiika dimbi, mwanki diba divedila na dilembolo ba na kibila. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ni bwabobo mpe babakala bafweni tiila bakento bawu bonso nitu zi yawu bende. Yondowo tiidi mukento andi, wukitiidi yandi bende. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Mu dyambu ti kuu muntu ko kwe belanga nitu yi yandi bende, kansi fweni ye dikila na fweni toma ye keba, bonso bukwe sanga Klisto ku dibundu, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />mu dyambu ti tudi binama bi nitu andi. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />«Ni hahoho, bakala kafweti sisa nzo yi ngudi andi na tata andi mu kwenda ba na mukento andi, mpe ya babole baaba nitu yimosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 2:34 </char></note>.» <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Mansweki mamanene maa hoho. Nteedidi bobo mu dyambu di Klisto na dibundu. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Kansi ku yeno mpe: kadi bakala katya mukento andi bonso yandi bende, mpe kadi mukento kavumina bakala dyandi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baala na bibuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Yeno baala, lufweti tumamanga ku bibuti byeno, bonso Mfumu bu katiidi, bwabobo budi budedama. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />«Vumina tata aku na ngudi aku», wo ni musiku wuntete, wuu na nsilulu, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />«mwanki wuba mu kyese mpe wuzinga bilumbu bibingi ha butoto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ex 20.12; Dt 5.16</char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Yeno matata, lufwemisandi baala beno ko, kansi bakudiseeno mu malongi na ndwengosolo zikwe fumanga ku Mfumu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zimfumu na mindongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Yeno mindongo, lufweti tumamanga ku zimfumu zeno zi ha butoto mu kivumi na mu kintekoto mpe mu mutima wuzibuka bonso bu lukwe tumamanga ku Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ka musanga bobo ha meso mawu kaka ko mu bayangidika, kansi lubatumamananga bonso mindongo mi Klisto mina hidika luzolo lu Nzambi mu mutima awu wumvimba. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Basadileno mu mutima wumosi, bonso ti Mfumu luna sadila, kansi ka bantu ko. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Zabeeno ti, Mfumu waahaana musendo ku kadi muntu, ni kaba mundongo hoti muntu wu kimpwanza, bonso buu mavanga mandi mambote makahidikidi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Yeno zimfumu, bwabobo kwandi mpe luhidika ku mindongo myeno. Lubavumisandi ko. Bu luzebi ti Mfumu yimosi kwandi yii neeno ku Yulu, yeno na mindongo myeno, yandi kakwe swasisanga bantu ko.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binwanunu bikwe haananga Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Mu manisa: soseeno ngolo zeno mu Mfumu na mu ngolo zi lulendo lwandi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Lwateno binwanunu bimvimba bi Nzambi, mwanki luba na lulendo lwe kanga nzila zi luvunu zi nkadyampemba. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Mu dyambu ti yeto tuna nwaninisa nsuni na menga ko, kansi baa na lulendo, zimfumu, minyadi mi nza beyiyi yi kitombe na mpeve zimbi zii ku Yulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ni hahoho, bongeeno binwanunu bimvimba bi Nzambi, mwanki luba basyama mu kilumbu kimbi na luba batelama nakekete bu lumeni nwana.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Telameeno nakekete: kangeeno kikedika mu nketo zeno bonso melika mpe lwateeno ludedomo bonso kisengo kikwe kebanga ntulu zeno. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Lwateeno vema mu samuna Musamu Wumbote wu kiyenge bonso nsampatu mu malu meno. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ntangu zimvimba bongeeno kiminu bonso kikaku, kikwe kakidilanga madyonga mamvimba matiya ma Munga Mbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Bongeeno mpulusu bonso mpu yi kisengo na Mambu ma Nzambi bonso mbele yi mvita yi Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ntangu zimvimba, sambilangeeno mu zinsambudulu na ndombolo zi mumpila na mumpila mu lusadusu lu Mpeve Yilongo. Ni hahoho, tatamanangeeno mu kaya meso, mboki sambidilangeeno kadi ntangu balongo bamvimba. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Nsambidilangeeno meno mpe, mwanki Nzambi kampana mpova zifwanakani bu na zonza, mu samuna na kivuvu kyonso mansweki ma Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Mu dyambu di Musamu Wumbote bewowo nidi kimonikisi kikangama mu misinga mi bisengo. Sambileeno mwanki nasamuna wo na kivuvu bonso bu nafweti we zonzila.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbote zimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tisiki, mpangi ani yi zola, kisadi kikwikama mu Mfumu, waaluyadila mpolo mu mimvimba, mwanki yeno mpe luzaba bwedi nidi, mpe nki nina sa. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ka mumpamba ko meno namutambikidi ku yeno, mwanki luzaba bwedi buu mavimpi meto, na kalusyamisa.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Bika Nzambi Tata na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kahaana ku zimpangi zimvimba kiyenge, zola na kiminu! <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Bika lusakumunu lu Nzambi luba ku bamvimba bakwe tyanga Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto mu luzolo lukwe lembolo hwanga.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>